<http://data.silknow.org/object/68f416df-0007-3530-bf13-a8266e47b1c7>
        a                       ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment            "Kerchief of woven silk, Great Britain, 1850-1875"@en , "Kerchief of woven silk. With a wreath of roses with smaller sprays of flowers protruding towards the centre of the wreath and large flowers extending into each corner. The design is woven in magenta silk bound with fancy twills. A sparse magenta and yellow silk fringe is knotted into all four sides."@en ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note        "Kerchief of woven silk, Great Britain, 1850-1875"@en , "Kerchief of woven silk. With a wreath of roses with smaller sprays of flowers protruding towards the centre of the wreath and large flowers extending into each corner. The design is woven in magenta silk bound with fancy twills. A sparse magenta and yellow silk fringe is knotted into all four sides."@en ;
